      "title": "Vibe Check · Models used & where to find them",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Vibe Check — Models used\n\nBoth models run as **Partner (API) nodes** on Comfy Cloud. Nothing to download or install — they are billed per run in credits.\n\n## 1. Prompt upsampler — Anthropic Claude (Sonnet 5.5)\n- **Node:** *Vibe Check · Flux 3 Prompt Upsampler (Claude)* — node type **Anthropic Claude**\n- **What it does:** turns the five answers into one detailed Flux 3 video prompt (scene, camera, lighting, colour, plus an \"Audio:\" line).\n- **Where to find it:** Node Library → **partner → text → Anthropic → Anthropic Claude** (or double-click the canvas and search \"Claude\").\n- **Settings:** model Sonnet 5.5, max tokens 1024, reasoning effort low. The upsampling instructions live in its *system_prompt*.\n- **Note:** there is no dedicated Flux 3 prompt-upsampler node, so Claude stands in for it.\n\n## 2. Video + sound — Flux 3 Text to Video (Black Forest Labs)\n- **Node:** *Vibe Check · Flux 3 Text to Video (with sound)* — node type **Flux 3 Text to Video**\n- **What it does:** generates the mood video with sound from the upsampled prompt.\n- **Where to find it:** Node Library → **partner → video → BFL → Flux 3 Text to Video** (or search \"Flux 3\"). A ready-made starter is also in the Templates gallery (Flux 3 text-to-video).\n- **Current settings:** 9:16, 10 seconds, 1080p, generate audio ON, seed 42.\n\n## Other nodes\nThe question boxes, Concatenate Text and Save Video are built-in core ComfyUI nodes (no models needed). Output files start with **vibe_check**."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Vibe Check — Models used\n\nBoth models run as **Partner (API) nodes** on Comfy Cloud. Nothing to download or install — they are billed per run in credits.\n\n## 1. Prompt upsampler — Anthropic Claude (Sonnet 5.5)\n- **Node:** *Vibe Check · Flux 3 Prompt Upsampler (Claude)* — node type **Anthropic Claude**\n- **What it does:** turns the five answers into one detailed Flux 3 video prompt (scene, camera, lighting, colour, plus an \"Audio:\" line).\n- **Where to find it:** Node Library → **partner → text → Anthropic → Anthropic Claude** (or double-click the canvas and search \"Claude\").\n- **Settings:** model Sonnet 5.5, max tokens 1024, reasoning effort low. The upsampling instructions live in its *system_prompt*.\n- **Note:** there is no dedicated Flux 3 prompt-upsampler node, so Claude stands in for it.\n\n## 2. Video + sound — Flux 3 Text to Video (Black Forest Labs)\n- **Node:** *Vibe Check · Flux 3 Text to Video (with sound)* — node type **Flux 3 Text to Video**\n- **What it does:** generates the mood video with sound from the upsampled prompt.\n- **Where to find it:** Node Library → **partner → video → BFL → Flux 3 Text to Video** (or search \"Flux 3\"). A ready-made starter is also in the Templates gallery (Flux 3 text-to-video).\n- **Current settings:** 9:16, 10 seconds, 1080p, generate audio ON, seed 42.\n\n## Other nodes\nThe question boxes, Concatenate Text and Save Video are built-in core ComfyUI nodes (no models needed). Output files start with **vibe_check**."
      },
